{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type OnSubmitError<TFormValidationError> = TFormValidationError & object;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L44","children":[{"type":"text","value":"FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:44"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A validation error marked for processing as an "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onSubmit"},{"type":"text","value":" failure."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Create this value with the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createValidationError"},{"type":"text","value":" or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"parseIssues"},{"type":"text","value":" helper\nprovided to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onSubmit"},{"type":"text","value":", then return it from the callback so its form- and\nfield-level errors are added to validation state."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-declaration","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Declaration"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"onsubmiterrorbrand","children":[{"type":"text","value":"[onSubmitErrorBrand]"}]},{"type":"code","value":"[onSubmitErrorBrand]: true;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Internal brand used to identify submit errors. Do not access directly."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tformvalidationerror","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TFormValidationError"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFormValidationError"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"FormValidationError.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"FormValidationError"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"any"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Library-managed. Do not specify explicitly."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"formOptions({\n  defaultValues: { name: '' },\n  onSubmit: async ({ value, createValidationError }) => {\n    const result = await saveUser(value)\n\n    if (!result.ok) {\n      return createValidationError(result.error)\n    }\n  },\n})","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"type-declaration","text":"Type Declaration","level":2},{"id":"onsubmiterrorbrand","text":"[onSubmitErrorBrand]","level":3},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tformvalidationerror","text":"TFormValidationError","level":3},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype OnSubmitError<TFormValidationError> = TFormValidationError & object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:44](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L44)\n\nA validation error marked for processing as an `onSubmit` failure.\n\nCreate this value with the `createValidationError` or `parseIssues` helper\nprovided to `onSubmit`, then return it from the callback so its form- and\nfield-level errors are added to validation state.\n\n## Type Declaration\n\n### \\[onSubmitErrorBrand\\]\n\n```ts\n[onSubmitErrorBrand]: true;\n```\n\nInternal brand used to identify submit errors. Do not access directly.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFormValidationError\n\n`TFormValidationError` *extends* [`FormValidationError`](FormValidationError.md)\\<`any`\\>\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nformOptions({\n  defaultValues: { name: '' },\n  onSubmit: async ({ value, createValidationError }) => {\n    const result = await saveUser(value)\n\n    if (!result.ok) {\n      return createValidationError(result.error)\n    }\n  },\n})\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: OnSubmitError\ntitle: OnSubmitError\n---\n\n```ts\ntype OnSubmitError<TFormValidationError> = TFormValidationError & object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:44](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L44)\n\nA validation error marked for processing as an `onSubmit` failure.\n\nCreate this value with the `createValidationError` or `parseIssues` helper\nprovided to `onSubmit`, then return it from the callback so its form- and\nfield-level errors are added to validation state.\n\n## Type Declaration\n\n### \\[onSubmitErrorBrand\\]\n\n```ts\n[onSubmitErrorBrand]: true;\n```\n\nInternal brand used to identify submit errors. Do not access directly.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFormValidationError\n\n`TFormValidationError` *extends* [`FormValidationError`](FormValidationError.md)\\<`any`\\>\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nformOptions({\n  defaultValues: { name: '' },\n  onSubmit: async ({ value, createValidationError }) => {\n    const result = await saveUser(value)\n\n    if (!result.ok) {\n      return createValidationError(result.error)\n    }\n  },\n})\n```\n"}
